## GitHub settings: loading spinner and disabled-mirror warning
================================================================================

Context:
After a successful "Test connection", saves were still not pushed: the saved
config had "enabled": false. Test does not depend on that flag, so nothing in
the UI showed that the mirror was off. The section also showed an empty form
while the settings and secret scope/key lists were loading.

