   The status line shows a warning when the mirror is disabled or push-on-save
   is off. A successful Test adds the same warning. Settings are reloaded
   after Save and Test. The form shows on first load completion, and the
   header Save button is enabled only after a successful load (prevents
   posting an empty form over the saved settings).
